# Binaries & Installers
*.exe
*.msix
*.msi
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# OS Metadata & System files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# IDE & Editor configs
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Video
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Camera masters stay OUT of git. Cloudflare refuses any single file
# over 25 MB, and the 4K originals here are ~90 MB each.
#
# Only the small web-ready loops are committed. They carry a "-web"
# suffix precisely so a master can never be added by accident — no
# master is ever named that way.
video/*
!video/README.txt
!video/*-web.mp4

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Images
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The site loads .webp everywhere (2.3 MB for the whole set). The .png
# originals of those same photographs total ~33 MB and are never
# referenced — keep them local. The two logo PNGs ARE used, so they
# are allowed back in below.
images/*.png
!images/logo-full.png
!images/logo-mark.png
!images/logo-wordmark.png

# Stray tooling that ended up in images/
images/DnsJumper/
